   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">General question: Results related to the intended outcome 2016Question: Summarise results related to the intended outcome (this information will be sent to Open Aid)Answer: There is a positive development in terms of the growing momentum among the member states to use IGAD as a vehicle for increased regional cooperation in the area of peace and security. There is widely held view that the most important asset of IGAD has been its ability to convene higher level political discussion on a very short notice to respond to crises.</narrative>
